> to eat a corpse it says "you have a hard time..." -- and allows
> me to stop eating. I assumed that it was safe :). I guess I'll fast
> for some time to get not-hungry-not-satiated.

If you have a hard time eating a corpse, and are given a chance to stop
eating, you should. If you finish eating, there was no problem. However,
once you got this message you are *really* full, and should be wary to
eat anything else until most of it has been digested.

Your stomach can only contain a certain amount of food, and the
"satiated" message on your screen means that it is nearly full.

>    In fact the altar I found was on DL 1 (sic!) and it was
